  "description": "U-Ju Hyeon dreams of living the ordinary life of a high school student, but his dream will never come true as he possesses special powers that others don’t have. One day, after being chased by an evil spirit, he is taken to the School of the Tiger and learns that he has a dragon orb in his body. Will U-Ju be able to protect himself and the dragon orb from evil spirits? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)",
